Revision history for Geo-Location-Predicate

0.02	Sun Oct 18 08:56:13 PM EDT 2026
	MIN_PERL_VERSION is 5.8.3, the first perl whose Exporter supports
	"use Exporter qw(import)"; 0.01 claimed 5.8.0 and could not load there.
	META licence is gpl_2, matching LICENSE (it said open_source).
	The rule is unchanged in behaviour.  Its documentation now says it answers
	exactly 1 or 0, that "digit" means Unicode Nd, and lists its LIMITATIONS.
	New tests pin the debatable cases (whitespace, numeric stringification,
	overloaded objects), freedom from side effects, and locale independence.

0.01	Sun Oct 18 11:44:43 AM EDT 2026
	First release: the location rule moved out of Geo-Coder-Free 0.48, under a
	name of its own.
